  "critique": {
    "axis": "memorability",
    "evidence": "The contrarian “Accuracy is the wrong question” headline, evaluation-ledger framing, and restrained cyan/red defense-console palette create a recognizable opening across all viewports. Below it, however, the experience becomes a conventional dark analytics dashboard: KPI cards, standard line/bar charts, confusion matrix, and comparison table. The global header reinforces the lab identity but does not give Metrics a singular demo moment.",
    "fix": "Turn the operating-constraint thesis into one signature visual: an interactive false-positive-budget control that visibly transforms recall, blocked value, latency, and the confusion matrix together. Make that coordinated tradeoff the hero artifact and reduce the surrounding generic card treatment.",
